{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 36,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        42.10532760620117,
        399.6929931640625,
        51.276031494140625
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 2 It is suggested that contact investigation be conducted for household",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.5692138671875,
        54.273040771484375,
        400.27783203125,
        63.273040771484375
      ],
      "text": "and close contacts of all other index cases with pulmonary tuberculosis,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.70420837402344,
        66.27005004882812,
        362.31610107421875,
        75.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "in addition to the index cases covered in Recommendation 1.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.71321105957031,
        84.27005004882812,
        344.1361083984375,
        93.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "Conditional recommendation, very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.72221374511719,
        114.26705932617188,
        157.11622619628906,
        123.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "Remark",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55860900878906,
        126.27603149414062,
        399.7092590332031,
        135.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "Although priority should be given to index cases, as described in",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.57661437988281,
        138.27304077148438,
        399.7273254394531,
        147.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 1, if the resources are available, programmes and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.60360717773438,
        150.27005004882812,
        399.7183532714844,
        159.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "clinicians may wish to conduct contact investigation for index cases of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.5946044921875,
        162.26705932617188,
        399.5291442871094,
        171.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "lower priority. Such investigations should not detract from high-priority",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.3966064453125,
        174.26406860351562,
        399.6915588378906,
        183.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "situations. Transmission can occur from smear-negative cases. Molecular",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.56761169433594,
        186.26107788085938,
        399.6915588378906,
        195.27908325195312
      ],
      "text": "epidemiological studies in San Francisco showed that approximately",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55862426757812,
        198.27609252929688,
        400.1413269042969,
        207.27609252929688
      ],
      "text": "17% of new cases resulted from transmission from smear-negative,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.57662963867188,
        210.27001953125,
        399.6954040527344,
        219.27310180664062
      ],
      "text": "culture-positive cases (17). In British Colombia (18) and The Netherlands",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.56259155273438,
        222.26702880859375,
        399.6412658691406,
        231.26702880859375
      ],
      "text": "(19), transmission from smear-negative cases accounted for 16% and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.51759338378906,
        234.2640380859375,
        247.46966552734375,
        243.2640380859375
      ],
      "text": "12%, respectively, of new cases.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.485591888427734,
        270.09332275390625,
        399.7042236328125,
        279.2640380859375
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 3 Clinical evaluation of household and close contacts for active TB is",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.57159423828125,
        282.26104736328125,
        399.668212890625,
        291.26104736328125
      ],
      "text": "recommended as a priority on the basis of their risk for having or",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.54460144042969,
        294.258056640625,
        399.6888427734375,
        303.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "developing active TB or for the potential consequences of the disease if",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.56500244140625,
        306.2728576660156,
        276.74005126953125,
        315.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "it develops. Priority should be given to:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.56500244140625,
        324.2728576660156,
        334.78094482421875,
        333.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "• people of all ages with symptoms suggestive of TB,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.57400512695312,
        340.1535339355469,
        233.36004638671875,
        351.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "< • children   5 years of age,",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.5830078125,
        360.2728576660156,
        399.69775390625,
        369.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "• people with known or suspected immunocompromising conditions",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.07000732421875,
        372.2698669433594,
        221.01199340820312,
        381.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "(especially PLHIV) and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.56500244140625,
        390.2698669433594,
        401.6420593261719,
        399.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "• contacts of index cases with MDR-TB or XDR-TB (proven or suspected).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55599975585938,
        408.2698669433594,
        324.7639465332031,
        417.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "Strong recommendation, very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.56500244140625,
        438.2668762207031,
        161.93600463867188,
        447.2668762207031
      ],
      "text": "Remark 1",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55860900878906,
        450.2760314941406,
        399.6825256347656,
        459.2760314941406
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation complements and to some extent overlaps with",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.54960632324219,
        462.2730407714844,
        399.77215576171875,
        471.2730407714844
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 1 but focuses on the contact rather than the index",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.63960266113281,
        474.2700500488281,
        399.8171691894531,
        483.2700500488281
      ],
      "text": "case. Prioritization of contacts for clinical evaluation is based on an",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.68460083007812,
        486.26702880859375,
        399.85357666015625,
        495.26702880859375
      ],
      "text": "assessment of the risks posed by the index case, the circumstances of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.72959899902344,
        498.2640075683594,
        399.5205383300781,
        507.2640075683594
      ],
      "text": "the exposure and features of the contact. Given that overall about 3.5–",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.78359985351562,
        510.2610168457031,
        399.7004699707031,
        519.279052734375
      ],
      "text": "5.5% of all household contacts (9.6% in young children) are found to",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.57658386230469,
        522.2715454101562,
        399.7457580566406,
        531.2760620117188
      ],
      "text": "have TB at the time of initial evaluation, identiﬁcation of contacts with",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.61300659179688,
        534.2685546875,
        399.7275695800781,
        543.2685546875
      ],
      "text": "symptoms is a critical step in contact investigation. All prioritized",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.60400390625,
        546.2655639648438,
        399.7818603515625,
        555.2655639648438
      ],
      "text": "contacts identiﬁed should be evaluated for symptoms of TB, including",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.64900207519531,
        558.2625732421875,
        399.8088073730469,
        567.2625732421875
      ],
      "text": "cough, fever, night sweats, weight loss and haemoptysis. Symptomatic",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.68499755859375,
        570.2595825195312,
        400.16888427734375,
        579.2595825195312
      ],
      "text": "contacts should be evaluated as for any person suspected of having TB.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.6669921875,
        582.2565307617188,
        400.1390380859375,
        591.2745361328125
      ],
      "text": "Contacts with cough should submit sputum specimens for microscopy,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.5740966796875,
        594.2697143554688,
        399.74273681640625,
        603.2697143554688
      ],
      "text": "as recommended for suspected cases of TB. Contacts with negative",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.61909484863281,
        606.2666625976562,
        399.7247009277344,
        615.2666625976562
      ],
      "text": "sputum smears should be evaluated according to the guidelines for",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.60108947753906,
        618.263671875,
        399.7608947753906,
        627.263671875
      ],
      "text": "smear-negative TB (3). Contacts of PLHIV and children may be less likely",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        217.3218994140625,
        651.97265625,
        224.889404296875,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "34",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}